    {
      "depth": 2,
      "text": "UAS Tool-inställningar i pref-format: Med användning av SRT",
      "id": "uas-tool-inställningar-i-pref-format-med-användning-av-srt"
    },
    {
      "depth": 3,
      "text": "Om du vill att videoströmmen ska börja sändas automatiskt när drönaren ansluts kan du lägga till detta kommando:",
      "id": "om-du-vill-att-videoströmmen-ska-börja-sändas-automatiskt-när-drönaren-ansluts-kan-du-lägga-till-detta-kommando"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>Uastool ATAK-plugin kan användas för att strömma livevideo till MediaMTX-servern och därifrån vidare till Tak-servern och användarna.</p>\n<h2 id=\"uas-tool-inställningar-i-pref-format-med-användning-av-srt\"><a href=\"#uas-tool-inställningar-i-pref-format-med-användning-av-srt\">UAS Tool-inställningar i pref-format: Med användning av SRT</a></h2>"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">&#x3C;?</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">xml</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">'1.0'</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> standalone</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">'yes'</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">?></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">preferences</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">preference</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">'1'</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">'com.atakmap.app_preferences'</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\">    &#x3C;!-- UAS tool settings --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"uastool.ROUTES_WAYPOINTS_OVERLAY\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"class java.lang.Boolean\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">>true&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"uastool.pref_callsign\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"class java.lang.String\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">>UAS-CALLSIGN&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"uastool.pref_poi_id_template\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"class java.lang.String\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">>%-POI&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"uastool.pref_ui_ar_on\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"class java.lang.Boolean\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">>true&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"uastool.pref_ui_dont_show_warning\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"class java.lang.Boolean\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">>true&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"uastool.fov_use_dted\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"class java.lang.Boolean\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">>true&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"uastool.pref_cot_broadcast\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"class java.lang.Boolean\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">>true&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"uastool.pref_broadcast_ssl\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"class java.lang.Boolean\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">>true&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"uastool.pref_broadcast_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"class java.lang.String\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">>1920x1080 (high)&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\">    &#x3C;!-- Bitrate must match broadcast resolution to avoid encoder throttling --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"uastool.pref_video_broadcast_bitrate\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"class java.lang.String\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">>10000&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"uastool.pref_video_broadcast_destination\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"class java.lang.String\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">>SRT (Video Management System)&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"uastool.pref_srt_dest_host\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"class java.lang.String\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">>TESTI.FI&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"uastool.pref_srt_dest_port\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"class java.lang.String\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">>8890&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"uastool.pref_srt_stream_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"class java.lang.String\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">>publish:live/uas/CALLSIGN:USERNAME:PASSWORD&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"uastool.pref_video_observer_url\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"class java.lang.String\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">>rtmps://TESTI.FI:1936/live/uas/CALLSIGN?user=USERNAME</span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">pass=PASSWORD&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\">    &#x3C;!-- Optional SRT encryption --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\">    &#x3C;!-- &#x3C;entry key=\"uastool.pref_srt_passphrase\" class=\"class java.lang.String\">testitestitesti&#x3C;/entry> --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">preference</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">preferences</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span></code></pre>",
      "lang": "xml"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>I exemplet utförs strömningen via SRT-port 8890 och visningen av strömmen sker via RTSPS-port 8322. Byt adressen TESTI.FI till adressen för din egen server och CALLSIGN till ditt eget anropsnamn.</p>\n<h3 id=\"om-du-vill-att-videoströmmen-ska-börja-sändas-automatiskt-när-drönaren-ansluts-kan-du-lägga-till-detta-kommando\"><a href=\"#om-du-vill-att-videoströmmen-ska-börja-sändas-automatiskt-när-drönaren-ansluts-kan-du-lägga-till-detta-kommando\">Om du vill att videoströmmen ska börja sändas automatiskt när drönaren ansluts kan du lägga till detta kommando:</a></h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">&#x3C;?</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">xml</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">'1.0'</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> standalone</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">'yes'</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">?></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">preferences</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">preference</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">'1'</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">'com.atakmap.app_preferences'</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"uastool.pref_auto_broadcast\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"class java.lang.Boolean\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">>true&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">preference</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#E06C75\">preferences</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">></span></span></code></pre>",
      "lang": "xml"
    }
  ]
}
